From 9d1e2d0834c717d522c53b48e6b6da20d10d76f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LR Recomp <noreply@lr-recomp.invalid>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:28:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 044/108] gpu: vulkan: GPU timing per render pass signature,
 pass end reasons and transfer pairs

With vulkan_gpu_timing, timestamps also split draw and transfer segments
when the render pass signature (RenderPassKey and pitch) changes, and the
10-s log adds GPU time, passes and draws per signature, why render pass
instances end (framebuffer change, barrier kind, forced) and the most
frequent ownership transfers by source and destination format.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

